BEGIN:VEVENT
UID:3@www.midlandacademy.org
DTSTAMP;TZID=America/Chicago:20190611T165851
SUMMARY:Back to School Night
DESCRIPTION:Come enjoy a delicious veggie burger dinner and fellowship with
  friends and staff of Midland Adventist Academy!  Following dinner and a f
 ew introductions\, be sure to take a few minutes to visit with the teacher
 s in the classrooms. The fun begins at 5:30pm on Monday\, August 19. On be
 half of MAA's Home & School leaders\, we look forward to seeing you there!
X-ALT-DESC;FMTTYPE=TEXT/HTML:Come enjoy a delicious veggie burger dinner an
 d fellowship with friends and staff of Midland Adventist Academy!  Followi
 ng dinner and a few introductions\, be sure to take a few minutes to visit
  with the teachers in the classrooms. The fun begins at 5:30pm on Monday\,
  August 19. On behalf of MAA's Home & School leaders\, we look forward to 
 seeing you there!
CATEGORIES:Home & School
DTSTART;TZID=America/Chicago:20190819T173000
DTEND;TZID=America/Chicago:20190819T183000
LOCATION:Midland Adventist Academy
END:VEVENT
